      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those symptoms of excessive thirst and frequent urination are known as polyuria and polydipsia, and they are classic signs associated with uncontrolled high blood sugar. While dehydration can worsen these feelings, these symptoms can also be a sign that your blood sugar levels are still elevated despite the new supplement. It is very important that you contact your healthcare provider right away to discuss these new symptoms. They can properly monitor your sugar levels and adjust your treatment plan safely.",
      "source": "target",
