      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im not really sure i can get to a doctor today, i work all day and my clinic closes early. it feels like its just because of the berberine tho since it started right when i began the pills. do u think i could just drink more water and maybe take an extra dose of the berberine to help balance things out? i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing if its just a supplement thing.",
